{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-1","title":"2 Timothy 4:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 He exhorts him to do his duty with all care and diligence; 6 certifies him of the nearness of his death; 9 wills him to come speedily unto him, and to bring Marcus with him, and certain things which he wrote for; 14 warns him to beware of Alexander the smith. 16 informs him what had befallen him at his first answering; 19 and soon after he concludes.</p>\n<p>charge. 2:14; 1Ti 5:21; 6:13 who. Ps 50:6; 96:13; 98:9; Mt 16:27; 25:31-46; Joh 5:22-27; Ac 10:42 Ac 17:31; Ro 2:16; 14:9-11; 1Co 4:4,5; 2Co 5:9,10; 2Th 1:7-10 1Pe 4:5; Re 20:11-15 at. 8; Col 3:4; 1Th 4:15,16; 1Ti 6:14; Tit 2:13; Heb 9:27,28; 1Pe 1:7 1Pe 5:4; 1Jo 2:28; Re 1:7 his kingdom. Lu 19:12,15; 23:42; 2Pe 1:11,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-2","title":"2 Timothy 4:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Preach. Ps 40:9; Isa 61:1-3; Jon 3:2; Lu 4:18,19; 9:60; Ro 10:15 Col 1:25,28 be. Lu 7:4,23; Ac 13:5; *marg: Ro 12:12; 1Ti 4:15,16 in. Joh 4:6-10,32-34; Ac 16:13,31-33; 20:7,18-21; 28:16,30,31 reprove. Col 1:28,29; 1Th 2:11,12; 5:14; 5:20; Tit 1:13; 2:15; Heb 13:22 Re 3:19 exhort. 1Ti 4:13 all. 2:21,25; 3:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-3","title":"2 Timothy 4:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>the time. 3:1-6; 1Ti 4:1-3 they will. 1Ki 22:8,18; 2Ch 16:9,10; 24:20-22; 25:15,16; Isa 28:12; 33:9-11 Jer 6:16,17; 18:18; Am 7:10-17; Lu 20:19; Joh 8:45; Ga 4:16 sound. 1Ti 1:10 but. 3:6; 1Ki 18:22; 2Ch 18:4,5; Jer 5:31; 23:16,17; 27:9; 29:8; Mic 2:11 Lu 6:26; Joh 3:19-21; 2Pe 2:1-3 having. Ex 32:33; Ac 17:21; *Gr: 1Co 2:1,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-4","title":"2 Timothy 4:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>turn. 1:15; Pr 1:32; Zec 7:11; Ac 7:57; Heb 13:25 unto. 1Ti 1:4; 4:7; Tit 1:14; 2Pe 1:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-5","title":"2 Timothy 4:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>watch. Isa 56:9,10; 62:6; Jer 6:17; Eze 3:17; 33:2,7; Mr 13:34,37; Lu 12:37 Ac 20:30,31; 1Th 5:6; Heb 13:17; Re 3:2 endure. 1:8; 2:3,10; 3:10-12 an. Ac 21:8; Eph 4:11; 1Ti 4:12,15 make full proof of. or, fulfil. Ro 15:19; Col 1:25; 4:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-6","title":"2 Timothy 4:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>I am. Php 2:17 and. Ge 48:21; 50:24; Nu 27:12-17; De 31:14; Jos 23:14; Php 1:23 2Pe 1:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-7","title":"2 Timothy 4:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>have thought. 1Ti 6:12 I have finished. Joh 4:34; Ac 13:25; 20:24; 1Co 9:24-27; Php 3:13,14; Heb 12:1,2 I have kept. 1:14; Pr 23:23; Lu 8:15; 11:28; Joh 17:6; 1Ti 6:20; Re 3:8,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-8","title":"2 Timothy 4:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>there. Ps 31:19; Mt 6:19,20; Col 1:5; 1Ti 6:19 a crown. 2:5; Pr 4:9; 1Co 9:25; Jas 1:12; 1Pe 5:4; Re 2:10; 4:4,10 the righteous. 1; Ge 18:25; Ps 7:11; Ro 2:5; 2Th 1:5,6; Re 19:11 at that. 1:12,18; Mal 3:17; Mt 7:22; 24:36; Lu 10:12; 1Th 5:4 that love. Ro 8:23; 1Co 2:9; 2Co 5:2; 1Th 1:10; Tit 2:13; Heb 9:28; Re 1:7 Re 22:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-9","title":"2 Timothy 4:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>21; 1:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-10","title":"2 Timothy 4:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Demas. Col 4:14,15; Phm 1:24 hath. 16; 1:15; Mt 26:56; Ac 13:13; 15:38; 2Pe 2:15 having. Lu 9:61,62; 14:26,27,33; 16:13; 17:32; Php 2:21; 1Ti 6:10 1Jo 2:15,16; 5:4,5 Thessalonica. Ac 17:1,11,13 Galatia. Ac 16:6; 18:23; Ga 1:2 Titus. 2Co 2:13; 7:6; 8:6,16; Ga 2:1-3; Tit 1:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-11","title":"2 Timothy 4:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Only. 1:15 Luke. Ac 16:10; Col 4:14; Phm 1:24 Mark. Ac 12:12,25; 15:39; Col 4:10; 1Pe 5:13; Ho 14:4 for. Mt 19:30; 20:16; Lu 13:30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-12","title":"2 Timothy 4:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Tychicus. Ac 20:4; Eph 6:21; Col 4:7; Tit 3:12 to. Ac 20:16,17,25; 1Ti 1:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-13","title":"2 Timothy 4:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>cloak. 1Co 4:11; 2Co 11:27 Troas. Ac 16:8,11; 20:5-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-14","title":"2 Timothy 4:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Alexander. Ac 19:33,34; 1Ti 1:20 reward. 1Sa 24:12; 2Sa 3:39; Ps 28:4; 109:5-20; Jer 15:15; 18:19-23; 2Th 1:6 1Jo 5:16; Re 6:10; 18:6,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-15","title":"2 Timothy 4:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>be. Mt 10:16,17; Php 3:2 withstood. 3:8 words. or, preachings.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-16","title":"2 Timothy 4:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>answer. Ac 22:1; 25:16; 1Co 9:3; 2Co 7:11; Php 1:7,17; 1Pe 3:15; *Gr: no. 10; 1:15; Ps 31:11-13; Mr 14:50; Joh 16:32 I pray. Ac 7:60</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-17","title":"2 Timothy 4:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>the Lord. Ps 37:39,40; 109:31; Jer 15:20,21; 20:10,11; Mt 10:19; Ac 18:9,10 Ac 23:11; 27:23,24 strengthened. Isa 41:10,14; 2Co 12:9 by. Lu 21:15; Ac 9:15; 26:17,18; Ro 16:25,26; Eph 3:8; Php 1:12-14 and I. Ps 22:21; Pr 20:2; 28:15; Jer 2:30; Da 6:22,27; Heb 11:33; 1Pe 5:8 2Pe 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-18","title":"2 Timothy 4:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>deliver. Ge 48:16; 1Sa 25:39; 1Ch 4:10; Ps 121:7; Mt 6:13; Lu 11:4; Joh 17:15 1Co 10:13; 2Co 1:10; 2Th 3:3 and will. 1:12; Ps 37:28; 73:24; 92:10; Mt 13:43; 25:34; Lu 12:32; 22:29 Joh 10:28-30; 1Th 5:23; Jas 2:5; 1Pe 1:5; Jude 1:1,24 to whom. Ro 11:36; 16:27; Ga 1:5; 1Ti 1:17; 6:16; Heb 13:21; 1Pe 5:11; Jude 1:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-19","title":"2 Timothy 4:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Prisca. Ac 18:2,18,26; Ro 16:3,4; 1Co 16:19 Priscilla. the. 1:16-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-20","title":"2 Timothy 4:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>Erastus. Ac 19:22; Ro 16:23 Trophimus. Ac 20:4; 21:29 Miletum. Ac 20:15,17 Miletus. sick. Php 2:26,27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-21","title":"2 Timothy 4:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>thy. 9,13; 1:4 and all. Ro 16:21-23; 1Co 16:20; 2Co 13:13; Php 4:22; 2Jo 1:13; 3Jo 1:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-4-22","title":"2 Timothy 4:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>The Lord. Mt 28:20; Ro 16:20; 2Co 13:14; Ga 6:18; Phm 1:25 Grace. Ro 1:7; 1Co 16:23; Eph 6:24; Col 4:18; 1Ti 6:21; 1Pe 5:14; Re 22:21</p>"}]}